# Domains/URLs to skip in the external link check (one regex per line).
# These are known-flaky or bot-hostile hosts that produce false failures.

# Social / login-walled hosts that block automated requests
^https?://(www\.)?linkedin\.com/
^https?://(www\.)?facebook\.com/
^https?://(www\.)?instagram\.com/
^https?://(www\.)?twitter\.com/
^https?://x\.com/
^https?://t\.me/

# Frequently rate-limits or 999s automated checkers
^https?://(www\.)?reddit\.com/

# Local dev-server addresses used illustratively / by embedded demos (not real links)
^https?://0\.0\.0\.0
^https?://localhost
^https?://127\.0\.0\.1
